# Also used explicitly as the gcloud upload ignore file in docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
# These are exclusion patterns shared by Docker and Git-style ignore readers.
**/.git
**/.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/.cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/tmp_*
**/nul
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/tests
**/fixtures
**/docs
**/.env*
**/.npmrc
**/.config
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*service_account*.json
**/*-key.json
**/*-credentials.json
**/application_default_credentials.json
